# A second arrow well after J is a spin, not a diagonal: up and J, then right 8 ticks later (past
# tricks.dirTicks, 5) keeps the Impossible.
park lab
spawn lab_ledge
hold up 0..60
hold ollie 60..90
hold up 94..99
tap flip 96
hold right 104..106
run 300
expect event trickStart{trick=Impossible} within 97..97
expect no event trickStart{trick=Inward Heelflip}
expect event trickEnd{trick=Impossible} within 120..175
expect no event bail
